# AI Company Operating System

## Detailed Architecture & Low-Level Design (LLD)

---

# 1. Vision

Build a platform where users can:

* Create AI companies
* Define agents/roles
* Assign LLM providers
* Import/export company packages
* Execute workflows visually
* Control execution through Kanban
* Debug and replay AI work

The platform acts as:

> Jira + Temporal + AI Agent Runtime

---

# 2. Core Product Principles

## 2.1 Human-Controlled AI

The system must never become:

* fully autonomous
* uncontrollable
* opaque

Humans always:

* approve
* retry
* edit
* override

---

## 2.2 Task-Centric Execution

The platform is NOT agent-chat based.

Everything revolves around:

* Tasks
* Dependencies
* Execution states
* Structured context

---

## 2.3 Structured Data Flow

Agents communicate through:

* JSON schemas
* Typed context
* Workflow outputs

NOT through raw prompt chaining.

---

