# 9. Workflow Graph Engine

## Purpose

Responsible for:

* dependency management
* task scheduling
* execution readiness
* workflow state tracking

---

# 9.1 DAG Model

```text
CEO
 ↓
CTO
 ↓
Product Owner
 ↓
 ┌─────────────┐
 ↓             ↓
Backend Dev   Frontend Dev
 └──────┬──────┘
        ↓
      Tester
```

---

# 9.2 Graph Construction

Input:

```yaml
steps:
  - id: cto
    dependsOn:
      - ceo
```

Converted into:

```java
Edge(from="ceo", to="cto")
```

---

# 9.3 Scheduler Algorithm

```java
while (!workflow.completed()) {

    List<TaskNode> readyNodes =
        workflow.findReadyNodes();

    for (TaskNode node : readyNodes) {
        executor.execute(node);
    }

    Thread.sleep(1000);
}
```

---

# 9.4 Task States

```text
BACKLOG
READY
IN_PROGRESS
BLOCKED
WAITING_APPROVAL
DONE
FAILED
```

