---

# 10.2 Context Builder

```java
JsonNode buildContext(TaskNode node) {

    List<String> required = node.getConsumes();

    return contextStore.fetch(required);
}
```

---

# 10.3 Prompt Builder

```java
String buildPrompt(TaskNode node, JsonNode context) {

    return templateEngine.render(
        node.getPromptTemplate(),
        context
    );
}
```

